<title>USA: Greenspan ends testimony to House Budget Committee.</title>
<headline>Greenspan ends testimony to House Budget Committee.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan on Tuesday completed his testimony to the House Budget Committee.</p>
<p>Much of the testimony centered on the Consumer Price Index and what can be done to fix it.</p>
</text>
